# http-runtime-gauntlet — EAV port (apps/http-runtime-gauntlet, semsc v0.1).
#
# FULL 1:1 port of the 27-operation native-HTTP conformance harness: the
# `webServer` entity with all 24 routes + 23 path-scoped middleware bindings,
# the two helper ops (addGauntletHeaders, writeTextResponse), all 23 route
# handlers, and the two middleware. Every http.* request-read / response-write /
# multipart / SSE call is converted; the v0.1 `webServer`/`serverHost`/
# `serverPort`/`route`/`routeMiddleware` keywords become the subject-anchored
# EAV webServer entity (`X is webServer` / `X host` / `X port` / `X route` /
# `X middleware`, README §14).
#
# Server *execution* is deferred: `target webServer` lowering is out of scope in
# v0.3 (§27), so this parses + lints clean (handler ABIs validated, routes
# exact-match-checked, middleware/effect coverage checked) but is not codegen'd.
# When webServer lowering lands, every route becomes an executable golden.
# (X-044)
#
# Conversions / language differences:
#   - middleware uses EAV's §14 ABI `(request, response, next NextMiddleware)
#     -> Bool` (true continues, false short-circuits) instead of the v0.1
#     `MiddlewareControl` enum: continueMiddlewareControl -> Bool true,
#     shortCircuitMiddlewareControl -> Bool false.
#   - `warning` -> the universal `risk` metadata predicate; the semsc-specific
#     `pinsNullBodyFailurePath` / `responseBodyForwarder` / `routeTimeoutOptOut`
#     linter-contract verbs become `rationale` rows (EAV has no SS3603/SS3602
#     equivalents).
#   - inline `call`/`argument`/`run`/`bind`/`ignore` records -> first-class
#     `call` entities with `arg`/`out`/`discards` (the §20 split).


appHttpRuntimeGauntlet is module
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet path apps.httpRuntimeGauntlet
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet exports httpRuntimeGauntletServer
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet exports httpRequestReader
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet exports httpResponseWriter
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet exports indexHandler
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet exports healthHandler
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet exports methodReflectHandler
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet exports pathReflectHandler
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet exports headerReflectHandler
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet exports requiredHeaderHandler
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet exports queryReflectHandler
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet exports queryEmptyHandler
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet exports queryRepeatHandler
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet exports bodyReflectHandler
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet exports bodyBytesReflectHandler
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet exports bodySizeHandler
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet exports multipartTextHandler
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet exports multipartFileNameHandler
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet exports multipartFileTypeHandler
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet exports multipartFileBytesHandler
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet exports sseOneEventHandler
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet exports capabilitiesOptionsHandler
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet exports customContentHandler
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet exports redirectHandler
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet exports emptyDeleteHandler
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet exports patchHandler
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet exports shortCircuitProbeHandler
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet exports shortCircuitProbeMiddleware
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet exports gauntletMiddleware
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet exports writeTextResponse
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet exports addGauntletHeaders
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet purpose "Native HTTP adapter conformance harness exercising every routing, request-read, response-write, multipart, SSE, and middleware edge"
appHttpRuntimeGauntlet invariant "Every dispatched route either guards nullable http.request* reads with pointer.isNull and returns 400 on absence, or pins the legacy null-body 500 contract (requiredHeaderHandler)"

HttpContentType is alias
HttpContentType for String
HttpContentType purpose "An HTTP response Content-Type value"

ByteCount is alias
ByteCount for Int64
ByteCount purpose "A byte length measured by the native adapter"

NextMiddleware is alias
NextMiddleware for OpaquePointer
NextMiddleware purpose "An opaque continuation to the next middleware/handler in the chain"

httpRequestReader is capability
httpRequestReader grants read http.request
httpRequestReader grants read http.request.method
httpRequestReader grants read http.request.path
httpRequestReader grants read http.request.header
httpRequestReader grants read http.request.query
httpRequestReader grants read http.request.body
httpRequestReader grants read http.request.multipart
httpRequestReader purpose "Authority to inspect request method, path, header, query, body, and multipart values (EAV grants are exact-match, so each narrower read path is enumerated; the v0.1 source relied on hierarchical http.request coverage)"

httpResponseWriter is capability
httpResponseWriter grants write http.response
httpResponseWriter purpose "Authority to write status, body, content type, and custom response headers"

okStatus is storage module immutable Int32 200
createdStatus is storage module immutable Int32 201
noContentStatus is storage module immutable Int32 204
redirectStatus is storage module immutable Int32 302
badRequestStatus is storage module immutable Int32 400
largeBodyThreshold is storage module immutable ByteCount 12
largeBodyThreshold purpose "Split body-size tests between the small fixture and the large fixture"

indexBody is storage module immutable String "http api gauntlet\nroutes: /health /reflect/method /reflect/path /reflect/header /reflect/required-header-or-fail /reflect/query /reflect/query-empty /reflect/query-repeat /reflect/body /reflect/body-bytes /reflect/body-size /multipart/text /multipart/file-name /multipart/file-type /multipart/file-bytes /events/one /capabilities /content/custom /redirect /empty /patch /middleware-short-circuit\nmissing-input routes respond 400; /reflect/required-header-or-fail intentionally still 500s on missing X-Gauntlet-Required; /middleware-short-circuit returns 418 from its middleware\n"
indexBody purpose "Static index response listing the HTTP Runtime Gauntlet routes and pinned edge-case behavior"

httpRuntimeGauntletServer is webServer
httpRuntimeGauntletServer host "127.0.0.1"
httpRuntimeGauntletServer port 18082
httpRuntimeGauntletServer route GET "/" indexHandler
httpRuntimeGauntletServer route GET "/health" healthHandler
httpRuntimeGauntletServer route GET "/reflect/method" methodReflectHandler
httpRuntimeGauntletServer route GET "/reflect/path" pathReflectHandler
httpRuntimeGauntletServer route GET "/reflect/header" headerReflectHandler
httpRuntimeGauntletServer route GET "/reflect/required-header-or-fail" requiredHeaderHandler
httpRuntimeGauntletServer route GET "/reflect/query" queryReflectHandler
httpRuntimeGauntletServer route GET "/reflect/query-empty" queryEmptyHandler
httpRuntimeGauntletServer route GET "/reflect/query-repeat" queryRepeatHandler
httpRuntimeGauntletServer route POST "/reflect/body" bodyReflectHandler
httpRuntimeGauntletServer route POST "/reflect/body-bytes" bodyBytesReflectHandler
httpRuntimeGauntletServer route POST "/reflect/body-size" bodySizeHandler
httpRuntimeGauntletServer route PUT "/reflect/body-size" bodySizeHandler
httpRuntimeGauntletServer route POST "/multipart/text" multipartTextHandler
httpRuntimeGauntletServer route POST "/multipart/file-name" multipartFileNameHandler
httpRuntimeGauntletServer route POST "/multipart/file-type" multipartFileTypeHandler
httpRuntimeGauntletServer route POST "/multipart/file-bytes" multipartFileBytesHandler
httpRuntimeGauntletServer route GET "/events/one" sseOneEventHandler
httpRuntimeGauntletServer route OPTIONS "/capabilities" capabilitiesOptionsHandler
httpRuntimeGauntletServer route GET "/content/custom" customContentHandler
httpRuntimeGauntletServer route GET "/redirect" redirectHandler
httpRuntimeGauntletServer route DELETE "/empty" emptyDeleteHandler
httpRuntimeGauntletServer route PATCH "/patch" patchHandler
httpRuntimeGauntletServer route GET "/middleware-short-circuit" shortCircuitProbeHandler
httpRuntimeGauntletServer middleware "/" gauntletMiddleware
httpRuntimeGauntletServer middleware "/health" gauntletMiddleware
httpRuntimeGauntletServer middleware "/reflect/method" gauntletMiddleware
httpRuntimeGauntletServer middleware "/reflect/path" gauntletMiddleware
httpRuntimeGauntletServer middleware "/reflect/header" gauntletMiddleware
httpRuntimeGauntletServer middleware "/reflect/required-header-or-fail" gauntletMiddleware
httpRuntimeGauntletServer middleware "/reflect/query" gauntletMiddleware
httpRuntimeGauntletServer middleware "/reflect/query-empty" gauntletMiddleware
httpRuntimeGauntletServer middleware "/reflect/query-repeat" gauntletMiddleware
httpRuntimeGauntletServer middleware "/reflect/body" gauntletMiddleware
httpRuntimeGauntletServer middleware "/reflect/body-bytes" gauntletMiddleware
httpRuntimeGauntletServer middleware "/reflect/body-size" gauntletMiddleware
httpRuntimeGauntletServer middleware "/multipart/text" gauntletMiddleware
httpRuntimeGauntletServer middleware "/multipart/file-name" gauntletMiddleware
httpRuntimeGauntletServer middleware "/multipart/file-type" gauntletMiddleware
httpRuntimeGauntletServer middleware "/multipart/file-bytes" gauntletMiddleware
httpRuntimeGauntletServer middleware "/events/one" gauntletMiddleware
httpRuntimeGauntletServer middleware "/capabilities" gauntletMiddleware
httpRuntimeGauntletServer middleware "/content/custom" gauntletMiddleware
httpRuntimeGauntletServer middleware "/redirect" gauntletMiddleware
httpRuntimeGauntletServer middleware "/empty" gauntletMiddleware
httpRuntimeGauntletServer middleware "/patch" gauntletMiddleware
httpRuntimeGauntletServer middleware "/middleware-short-circuit" shortCircuitProbeMiddleware
httpRuntimeGauntletServer purpose "Challenge every currently implemented native HTTP request, response, routing, and middleware edge"
httpRuntimeGauntletServer rationale "routeTimeout opt-out dropped: EAV webServer carries no per-route deadline; the Python harness owns request timeouts"

addGauntletHeaders is operation
addGauntletHeaders in response HttpResponse
addGauntletHeaders effect write http.response
addGauntletHeaders uses httpResponseWriter
addGauntletHeaders memory arena request
addGauntletHeaders async no
addGauntletHeaders purpose "Attach common response headers (X-Gauntlet-App, X-Gauntlet-Version) for cross-route identification"
addGauntletHeaders invariant "All header names/values are static; the op is Void because there is no caller-actionable status"
addGauntletHeaders let appHeaderName immutable String "X-Gauntlet-App"
addGauntletHeaders let appHeaderValue immutable String "http-runtime-gauntlet"
addGauntletHeaders let versionHeaderName immutable String "X-Gauntlet-Version"
addGauntletHeaders let versionHeaderValue immutable String "1"
addGauntletHeaders do appHeaderCall
addGauntletHeaders do versionHeaderCall
addGauntletHeaders return void

appHeaderCall is call
appHeaderCall in addGauntletHeaders
appHeaderCall invokes http.responseHeader
appHeaderCall arg response HttpResponse response
appHeaderCall arg name String appHeaderName
appHeaderCall arg value String appHeaderValue
appHeaderCall discards "per-header write status is ignored; failure surfaces at per-route assertions"

versionHeaderCall is call
versionHeaderCall in addGauntletHeaders
versionHeaderCall invokes http.responseHeader
versionHeaderCall arg response HttpResponse response
versionHeaderCall arg name String versionHeaderName
versionHeaderCall arg value String versionHeaderValue
versionHeaderCall discards "per-header write status is ignored; failure surfaces at per-route assertions"

writeTextResponse is operation
writeTextResponse in response HttpResponse
writeTextResponse in status Int32
writeTextResponse in body String
writeTextResponse out Int32
writeTextResponse effect write http.response
writeTextResponse uses httpResponseWriter
writeTextResponse memory arena request
writeTextResponse async no
writeTextResponse purpose "Write a plain text response through the adapter, with the gauntlet's common headers attached first"
writeTextResponse invariant "The body argument is forwarded unchanged to http.responseText; the caller ensures it is non-null"
writeTextResponse rationale "responseBodyForwarder(body): callers of this helper inherit the null-guard contract of http.responseText"
writeTextResponse do commonHeaderCall
writeTextResponse do writeTextResponseCall
writeTextResponse return writeTextResponseStatus

commonHeaderCall is call
commonHeaderCall in writeTextResponse
commonHeaderCall invokes addGauntletHeaders
commonHeaderCall arg response HttpResponse response

writeTextResponseCall is call
writeTextResponseCall in writeTextResponse
writeTextResponseCall invokes http.responseText
writeTextResponseCall arg response HttpResponse response
writeTextResponseCall arg status Int32 status
writeTextResponseCall arg body String body
writeTextResponseCall out writeTextResponseStatus Int32

indexHandler is operation
indexHandler in request HttpRequest
indexHandler in response HttpResponse
indexHandler out Int32
indexHandler effect write http.response
indexHandler uses httpResponseWriter
indexHandler memory arena request
indexHandler async no
indexHandler purpose "Return a compact route map for the gauntlet so operators and tests can discover the surface"
indexHandler invariant "The route map lists every current API family; the trailing note distinguishes the 400-on-missing-input contract from the one 500-pinning route"
indexHandler do indexResponseCall
indexHandler return indexResponseStatus

indexResponseCall is call
indexResponseCall in indexHandler
indexResponseCall invokes writeTextResponse
indexResponseCall arg response HttpResponse response
indexResponseCall arg status Int32 okStatus
indexResponseCall arg body String indexBody
indexResponseCall out indexResponseStatus Int32

