healthHandler in request HttpRequest
healthHandler in response HttpResponse
healthHandler out Int32
healthHandler effect write http.response
healthHandler uses httpResponseWriter
healthHandler memory arena request
healthHandler async no
healthHandler purpose "Return a minimal readiness body so external probes can poll for server liveness"
healthHandler invariant "Readiness stays static and side-effect free"
healthHandler let healthBody immutable String "ok\n"
healthHandler do healthResponseCall
healthHandler return healthResponseStatus

healthResponseCall is call
healthResponseCall in healthHandler
healthResponseCall invokes writeTextResponse
healthResponseCall arg response HttpResponse response
healthResponseCall arg status Int32 okStatus
healthResponseCall arg body String healthBody
healthResponseCall out healthResponseStatus Int32

