pathReflectHandler in request HttpRequest
pathReflectHandler in response HttpResponse
pathReflectHandler out Int32
pathReflectHandler effect read http.request.path
pathReflectHandler effect write http.response
pathReflectHandler uses httpRequestReader
pathReflectHandler uses httpResponseWriter
pathReflectHandler memory arena request
pathReflectHandler async no
pathReflectHandler purpose "Return the route path after query stripping"
pathReflectHandler invariant "http.requestPath returns a non-null pointer for any dispatched request, so no null guard is needed"
pathReflectHandler do pathReadCall
pathReflectHandler do pathResponseCall
pathReflectHandler return pathResponseStatus

pathReadCall is call
pathReadCall in pathReflectHandler
pathReadCall invokes http.requestPath
pathReadCall arg request HttpRequest request
