headerReflectHandler is operation
headerReflectHandler in request HttpRequest
headerReflectHandler in response HttpResponse
headerReflectHandler out Int32
headerReflectHandler effect read http.request.header
headerReflectHandler effect write http.response
headerReflectHandler uses httpRequestReader
headerReflectHandler uses httpResponseWriter
headerReflectHandler memory arena request
headerReflectHandler async no
headerReflectHandler purpose "Return the X-Gauntlet-Token request header when present, or a 400 with a static reason body when absent"
headerReflectHandler invariant "Token absent => http.requestHeader returns null => pointer.isNull guard branches to 400; present => 200 with the raw value"
headerReflectHandler risk "The 400-on-missing-token contract is part of the route's tested surface; do not switch back to the null-body 500 path"
headerReflectHandler let tokenHeaderName immutable String "x-gauntlet-token"
headerReflectHandler let tokenMissingBody immutable String "missing header: X-Gauntlet-Token\n"
headerReflectHandler do headerReadCall
headerReflectHandler do tokenMissingCheckCall
headerReflectHandler branch if tokenMissing goto headerMissingPath
headerReflectHandler do headerResponseCall
headerReflectHandler return headerResponseStatus
headerReflectHandler at headerMissingPath do headerMissingResponseCall
headerReflectHandler return headerMissingResponseStatus

headerReadCall is call
headerReadCall in headerReflectHandler
headerReadCall invokes http.requestHeader
headerReadCall arg request HttpRequest request
headerReadCall arg name String tokenHeaderName
headerReadCall out tokenHeaderValue String

tokenMissingCheckCall is call
tokenMissingCheckCall in headerReflectHandler
tokenMissingCheckCall invokes pointer.isNull
tokenMissingCheckCall arg pointer OpaquePointer tokenHeaderValue
tokenMissingCheckCall out tokenMissing Bool
tokenMissingCheckCall rationale "pointer.isNull is the only typed null detector; it emits a real icmp eq ptr,null so the branch has a real Bool"

headerResponseCall is call
headerResponseCall in headerReflectHandler
headerResponseCall invokes writeTextResponse
headerResponseCall arg response HttpResponse response
headerResponseCall arg status Int32 okStatus
headerResponseCall arg body String tokenHeaderValue
headerResponseCall out headerResponseStatus Int32

headerMissingResponseCall is call
headerMissingResponseCall in headerReflectHandler
headerMissingResponseCall invokes writeTextResponse
headerMissingResponseCall arg response HttpResponse response
headerMissingResponseCall arg status Int32 badRequestStatus
headerMissingResponseCall arg body String tokenMissingBody
headerMissingResponseCall out headerMissingResponseStatus Int32

requiredHeaderHandler is operation
requiredHeaderHandler in request HttpRequest
requiredHeaderHandler in response HttpResponse
requiredHeaderHandler out Int32
requiredHeaderHandler effect read http.request.header
requiredHeaderHandler effect write http.response
requiredHeaderHandler uses httpRequestReader
requiredHeaderHandler uses httpResponseWriter
requiredHeaderHandler memory arena request
requiredHeaderHandler async no
requiredHeaderHandler purpose "Negative-test route: 200 with the required header value when present, intentionally 500 (null body) when absent"
requiredHeaderHandler invariant "The gauntlet's one route that intentionally omits a pointer.isNull guard, pinning the adapter's null-body 500 path"
requiredHeaderHandler rationale "pinsNullBodyFailurePath: deliberate coverage of the adapter's null-body 500 path; do NOT add a pointer.isNull guard here"
requiredHeaderHandler risk "The 500-on-missing-X-Gauntlet-Required behavior is externally asserted; do not silence it by adding a guard"
requiredHeaderHandler let requiredHeaderName immutable String "x-gauntlet-required"
requiredHeaderHandler do requiredHeaderReadCall
requiredHeaderHandler do requiredHeaderResponseCall
requiredHeaderHandler return requiredHeaderResponseStatus

requiredHeaderReadCall is call
requiredHeaderReadCall in requiredHeaderHandler
requiredHeaderReadCall invokes http.requestHeader
requiredHeaderReadCall arg request HttpRequest request
requiredHeaderReadCall arg name String requiredHeaderName
requiredHeaderReadCall out requiredHeaderValue String

requiredHeaderResponseCall is call
requiredHeaderResponseCall in requiredHeaderHandler
requiredHeaderResponseCall invokes writeTextResponse
requiredHeaderResponseCall arg response HttpResponse response
requiredHeaderResponseCall arg status Int32 okStatus
requiredHeaderResponseCall arg body String requiredHeaderValue
requiredHeaderResponseCall out requiredHeaderResponseStatus Int32

