queryReflectHandler in request HttpRequest
queryReflectHandler in response HttpResponse
queryReflectHandler out Int32
queryReflectHandler effect read http.request.query
queryReflectHandler effect write http.response
queryReflectHandler uses httpRequestReader
queryReflectHandler uses httpResponseWriter
queryReflectHandler memory arena request
queryReflectHandler async no
queryReflectHandler purpose "Return the raw name query parameter when present, or a 400 with a static reason body when absent"
queryReflectHandler invariant "Distinguishes ?name=foo (verbatim 200) from absent (null bind => 400) and ?name= (empty string, 200)"
queryReflectHandler let nameQueryName immutable String "name"
queryReflectHandler let nameQueryMissingBody immutable String "missing query parameter: name\n"
queryReflectHandler do queryReadCall
queryReflectHandler do queryMissingCheckCall
queryReflectHandler branch if queryMissing goto queryReflectMissingPath
queryReflectHandler do queryResponseCall
queryReflectHandler return queryResponseStatus
queryReflectHandler at queryReflectMissingPath do queryReflectMissingResponseCall
queryReflectHandler return queryReflectMissingResponseStatus

queryReadCall is call
queryReadCall in queryReflectHandler
queryReadCall invokes http.requestQueryParam
queryReadCall arg request HttpRequest request
queryReadCall arg name String nameQueryName
queryReadCall out queryValue String

queryMissingCheckCall is call
queryMissingCheckCall in queryReflectHandler
queryMissingCheckCall invokes pointer.isNull
queryMissingCheckCall arg pointer OpaquePointer queryValue
queryMissingCheckCall out queryMissing Bool

queryResponseCall is call
queryResponseCall in queryReflectHandler
queryResponseCall invokes writeTextResponse
queryResponseCall arg response HttpResponse response
queryResponseCall arg status Int32 okStatus
queryResponseCall arg body String queryValue
queryResponseCall out queryResponseStatus Int32

